$$
\begin{aligned}
3T
&\geq\sum_{uv\in E}(d(u)+d(v)-n)\\
&=\sum_vd(v)^2-ne
\geq\frac{4e^2}{n}-ne
=e\left(\frac{4e}{n}-n\right).
\end{aligned}
$$
If $e>(1+\delta)n^2/4$, this is greater than
$\delta en>\delta n^3/4$. Therefore
